@startuml archi_from_image
title Project Gamer - Architecture

skinparam rectangle {
  Shadowing false
}

left to right direction

actor "Clients / Browser" as Clients

cloud "Frontend\nNext.js + TailwindCSS\n(image: node:20-alpine)\nport: 5173 (dev)" as Frontend {
  rectangle "Volumes:" as FrontVol {
    [./frontend:/app/frontend]
    [/app/frontend/node_modules]
  }
}

rectangle "Backend (NestJS)\n(image: node:20-alpine)\nport: 3000" as Backend {
  component "Modules:\n- Auth (JWT)\n- Challenge\n- Participation\n- Notification\n- Vote\n- User\n- Events" as Modules
  database "Prisma (ORM)\n(schema + migrations)" as Prisma
  rectangle "Volumes:" as BackVol {
    [./backend:/usr/src/backend]
    [/usr/src/backend/node_modules]
  }
}

database "PostgreSQL\n(image: postgres:17-alpine)\nport: 5432" as Postgres {
  rectangle "Volumes:" as DbVol {
    [./db:/var/lib/postgresql/data]
  }
}


Clients -down-> Frontend : HTTP(S) requests

Frontend --> Backend : API requests (HTTP 3000)

Prisma --> Postgres : SQL queries (5432)



@enduml